  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SuspectData
  FirstName: Lasha
  LastName: Gagua
  Nickname: 
  Occupation: Taxi Driver
  CharacterDescription: Confident, slightly aggressive and macho  tone. Mid 30's male just trying to get by, but comes off as a arrogant and easily aggravated. Clearly has anger issues and unresolved traumas.
  CharacterArc: 'His arc is one of explosive frustration; as the world stops making sense and his cab becomes useless, he directs his rage at the only thing he can still control: his interactions with the checkpoint.'
  DateOfBirth: 28/12/1954
