  exitDialoguesPassed:
    lastVerdict: 1
    dialoguesEarlyDays:
    - Finally. Try to work a bit faster next time, yeah?
    dialoguesMidDays:
    - "Yeah, yeah. Watch your back out here. It\u2019s getting ugly."
    dialoguesFinalDays:
    - Whatever. Enjoy your little cage while it lasts.
  exitDialoguesQuarantined:
    lastVerdict: 2
    dialoguesEarlyDays:
    - "You\u2019re kidding me. I don't have time for this circus!"
    dialoguesMidDays:
    - Lock me up then. At least I won't have to look at your face.
    dialoguesFinalDays:
    - "Fine. It\u2019s probably quieter in there than it is out here."
  exitDialoguesKilled:
    lastVerdict: 3
    dialoguesEarlyDays:
    - Hey! What are you...!
    dialoguesMidDays:
    - I knew you were looking for an excuse to pull that trigger!
    dialoguesFinalDays:
    - About time... someone... shut the world... up.
  quarantineExitLines:
  - You have GOT to be out of your mind right now, I swear!
  - FINE! But I want it on the record that this is completely, absolutely wrong!
  - "At least it\u2019ll be quieter in there than it is out here. Small mercies."
  killExitLines:
  - Of all the small-minded, cowardly...!
  - "You better hope\u2026 I don\u2019t come back\u2026 as a ghost\u2026 pal\u2026"
  - "Alright\u2026 alright\u2026 I\u2019ll give you this one\u2026 but just\u2026 this once\u2026"
